<tbody><tr>
<td width=3D"61%"><center>
<img align=3D"BOTTOM" src=3D"http://jurikres.com/gifs1/jma_anim.gif">=20
</center>
</td>
<td width=3D"39%"><p><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">This chart shows how =
modern
moving averages are getting ever closer to the performance of an ideal nois=
e
reduction filter. The best performer is still JMA.</font></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<br>
<br>
<br>
