</center>
<br>
<p><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Based on years of military research tha=
t used
computers to track moving targets, JMA is a powerful adaptive tracker that =
can
smooth time series data with very small lag, no overshoots and no oscillati=
ons.
The algorithm is stable and avoids the complexities of neural networks. JMA
delivers the best all around performance for smoothness, accuracy and
timeliness.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">JMA performs BETTER THAN OTHER SOPHISTI=
CATED
METHODS, including ... </font></p>
<blockquote><blockquote><ul>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Kalman's g, g-h, g-h-k filters, with o=
r
without fading memory</font></li>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Savitzky-Golay filters, with or withou=
t
fading memory</font></li>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Kaufman's adaptive moving average
(KAMA)</font></li>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Chande's Variable Index Dynamic Averag=
e
(VIDYA)</font></li>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Double Exponential Moving Average (DEM=
A)
</font></li>
<li><font face=3D"Bookman Old Style">Triple Exponential Moving Average (T3)
